  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are the product of monstrous experimental neurotechnology. Your mind isn't just a copy of someone else's: it is something entirely new and unique. You came into existence fully aware somewhere in the halls of Mordenheim Kinetics, with no idea who—or what—created you.</p><p>Your artificial nature drives you to adventure. Perhaps you hope to find an identity of your own, or allies with origins as mysterious as yours. Or perhaps you want revenge on the technicians responsible for your tormented existence.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.WjBUrOR3GLXBdZJw]{Echoing Soul} or a Dark Gift feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Deception and Insight</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulForgeryKit]{Forgery Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulForgeryKit]{Forgery Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInk00000000]{Ink}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInkPen00000]{Ink Pens}, 3 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSpikesIron0]{Iron Spikes}, 7 GP (as 7 dollars); or (B) 50 GP (as 50 dollars)</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
